  "surfaceLayersDiagram": "Layer 0 — Page:     #FFFFFF  (alternate sections #F6F6F6)\nLayer 1 — Card:     #FFFFFF + 1px #D8D8D8 border, no shadow\nLayer 2 — Sticky:   header (black), summary aside, CTA bar → --elevation-1\nLayer 3 — Menus:    --elevation-2\nLayer 4 — Popovers: --elevation-3\nLayer 5 — Modals:   --elevation-4 over --color-overlay-scrim",
  "notes": [
    "There is no breakpoint between 320px and 768px. Large phones (~430px) use the sm layout.",
    "File A's breakpoints are unverified. Replace them if live-site CSS is captured later (Official gap: \"Inspect the live site's CSS\").",
    "The sticky summary sidebar first appears at lg (1024px). Below that, the summary is a collapsible block plus the sticky CTA bar.",
    "At lg the sidebar is about 300px wide, so BookingSummary uses FlightSegment density=\"compact\" there.",
    "On the seat step, the seat selection panel takes the sidebar column, and the booking total moves to the top of that panel.",
    "Official: Emirates designs mobile-first, and over 60% of web traffic was mobile (2020)."
  ],
